<title>HONG KONG: IDT to pay HK$0.06 special interim div.</title>
<headline>IDT to pay HK$0.06 special interim div.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic and telecommunications products maker IDT International Ltd on Thursday announced a special interim dividend of HK$0.06 per share for the period April 1, 1996, to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The register of shareholders will be closed on May 17-22, and the pay date is May 26.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
